;. /propose_procedure_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition propose_procedure
  ;= Propose a reusable procedure from lessons
    This flow returns native values. Use the retain_result writer for a standalone occurrence. Compose project_result when a Nenex document is wanted. Publish the named child flows before publishing this composition; their exact definitions are captured.

    ;@ /flow/input lessons
    ;= lessons

    ;@ /flow/input sources
    ;= sources

    ;@ /flow/input provider
    ;= provider

    ;@ /flow/step task ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/procedure
    ;@ /flow/bind pages document
    ;@ /flow/bind sources sources
    ;@ /flow/bind context lessons
    ;= task

    ;@ /flow/step answered ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/interactive_requests
    ;@ /flow/bind tasks task
    ;@ /flow/bind provider provider
    ;= answered

    ;@ /flow/step result ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/results
    ;@ /flow/bind responses answered
    ;= result

    ;@ /flow/result result
    ;= Propose a reusable procedure from lessons result

    ;@ /flow/page /
    ;= Propose a reusable procedure from lessons
      Use the supported lessons to propose inputs, steps, checks, effects and note. Separate deterministic checks and native effects from judgment. Name reusable flows or declared operations only when established by the evidence. The result is a structured procedure proposal; use native Semidoc authoring or extraction for executable source, followed by explicit validation and publication.
